  "evidence": {
    "rob-recital": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3:sha256:9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3",
      "text_sha256": "9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Npa5tibg%3D%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 6057,
      "character_end": 6250,
      "quote": "In exercise of the powers conferred by Articles 90 and 99 of the Constitution of the \r\nIslamic Republic of Pakistan, the Federal Government is pleased to make the following \r\nrules:- \r\n \r\n   \r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3:sha256:9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3:chars-5157-6934:81fce96498973ae8840af6bd106736f5cfd60e803e790de3d8683ebcc4fcab88",
          "passage_sha256": "81fce96498973ae8840af6bd106736f5cfd60e803e790de3d8683ebcc4fcab88",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3.html#p-5157-6934-81fce96498973ae8"
        }
      ]
    },
    "rob-commencement": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3:sha256:9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3",
      "text_sha256": "9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Npa5tibg%3D%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 6272,
      "character_end": 6625,
      "quote": "1. 1Title, commencement and application .--(1) These rules may be called the \r\n\"Rules of Business, 1973.\" \r\n \r\n(2) They shall come into force on the fourteenth day of August 1973. \r\n2(3) They shall also apply, mutatis mutandis, when the business of the Government \r\nis conducted through automated or digitalized applications, platforms or systems. \r\n \r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3:sha256:9891101e1417c7fa89201f5f1c43111fd0c3e43eda7238611a14d7bfe6d15ef3:chars-5157-6934:81fce96498973ae8840af6bd106736f5cfd60e803e790de3d8683ebcc4fcab88",
          "passage_sha256": "81fce96498973ae8840af6bd106736f5cfd60e803e790de3d8683ebcc4fcab88",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-6c462b7d924dbbe3.html#p-5157-6934-81fce96498973ae8"
        }
      ]
    },
    "art90": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "text_sha256": "b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Fvbpw%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 116483,
      "character_end": 116975,
      "quote": "90. The Federal Government.__ (1) Subject to the Constitution, the executive authority of \r\nthe Federation shall be exercised in the name of the President by the Federal Government, consisting \r\nof the Prime Minister and the Federal Ministers, which shall act through the Prime Minister, who shall \r\nbe the chief executive of the Federation. \r\n (2) In the performance of his functions under the Constitution, the Prime Minister may act \r\neither directly or through the Federal Ministers.] \r\n ",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a:chars-116218-117999:97e963e875666a5ba7ffe6298b4a1e961857542092ce1c9605707640ac25b3b3",
          "passage_sha256": "97e963e875666a5ba7ffe6298b4a1e961857542092ce1c9605707640ac25b3b3",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a.html#p-116218-117999-97e963e875666a5b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "art99": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "text_sha256": "b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Fvbpw%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 124129,
      "character_end": 124755,
      "quote": "99. Conduct of business of Federal Government.__ (1) All executive actions of the Federal \r\nGovernment shall be expressed to be taken in the name of the President. \r\n (2) The 3[Federal Government] shall by rules specify the manner in which orders and other \r\ninstruments made and executed 3[in the name of the President] shall be authenticated, and the validity \r\nof any order or instrument so authenticated shall not be questioned in any court on the  ground that it \r\nwas not made or executed by the President. \r\n 3[(3) The Federal Government shall also make rules for the allocation and transaction of its \r\nbusiness.]] \r\n ",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a:chars-123376-125160:0836f9ecbcfad956bb710ff020dbf42b433006b729398292b2ad5eac84ddc0d6",
          "passage_sha256": "0836f9ecbcfad956bb710ff020dbf42b433006b729398292b2ad5eac84ddc0d6",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a.html#p-123376-125160-0836f9ecbcfad956"
        }
      ]
    },
    "art205": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "text_sha256": "b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Fvbpw%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 274232,
      "character_end": 274465,
      "quote": "205. Remuneration etc., of Judges.__ The remuneration and other ter ms and conditions of \r\nservice of a Judge of 3[Federal Constitutional Court or] the Supreme Court or of a High Court shall be \r\nas provided in the Fifth Schedule. \r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a:chars-274232-275972:2fcf9addd97cd41ab5123cdc6d5086c87b721476aebbdc8ac6c261ab71503008",
          "passage_sha256": "2fcf9addd97cd41ab5123cdc6d5086c87b721476aebbdc8ac6c261ab71503008",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a.html#p-274232-275972-2fcf9addd97cd41a"
        }
      ]
    },
    "schedule5-para2": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "text_sha256": "b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Fvbpw%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 454169,
      "character_end": 454618,
      "quote": "2. Every Judge of the 1[Federal Constitutional Court and the Supreme Court] shall be entitled to \r\nsuch privileges and allowances, and to such rights in respect of leave of absence and pension, as may \r\nbe determined by the President, and until so determined, to the privileges, allowances and rights to \r\nwhich, immediately before the commencing day, the Judges of the 1[Federal Constitutional Court and \r\nthe Supreme Court] 1[**] were entitled. \r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a:sha256:b4c3398abc155e5d543d326f4cd2167a25f194de0e6b274f64aa5058006f705a:chars-453835-455594:79e8638f1f901b7f0a18cee54dea9f84ed3001042dfdf959ea73d5f4b9117931",
          "passage_sha256": "79e8638f1f901b7f0a18cee54dea9f84ed3001042dfdf959ea73d5f4b9117931",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-30ecabb4a7ed433a.html#p-453835-455594-79e8638f1f901b7f"
        }
      ]
    },
    "fcc-recital": {
      "record_id": "pk-code-778412418cfa5e59",
      "text_version_id": "law:pk-code-778412418cfa5e59:sha256:9c5a7f685190e27dc4dadb28d1e85c6ff0e76046cef599bac0ccb1bc661493f9",
      "text_sha256": "9c5a7f685190e27dc4dadb28d1e85c6ff0e76046cef599bac0ccb1bc661493f9",
      "source_url": "https://pakistancode.gov.pk/alpha/UY2FqaJw1-apaUY2Fqa-apaUY2Npa5toaQ%3D%3D-sg-jjjjjjjjjjjjj",
      "character_start": 1246,
      "character_end": 1985,
      "quote": "[10th December, 2025] \r\nPRESIDENT’S ORDER NO. 3 OF 2025 \r\nWHEREAS paragraph 2 of the Fifth Schedule to the Constitution of Islamic Republic of Pakistan \r\nrelating to the Federal Constitutional Court provides that every Judge of the Federal Constitutional Court \r\nshall be entitled to such privileges and allowances, and to such rights in respect of leave of absence and \r\npension, as may be determined by the President; \r\nNOW THEREFORE,  in exercise of the said powers the President is pleased to make the \r\nfollowing Order: \r\nPART-I PRELIMINARY \r\n1. Short title and commencement.—(1) This order may be called the Federal Constitutional \r\nCourt Judges (Leave, Pension and Privileges) Order, 2025. \r\n(2) It shall come into force at once. \r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-778412418cfa5e59:sha256:9c5a7f685190e27dc4dadb28d1e85c6ff0e76046cef599bac0ccb1bc661493f9:chars-0-1794:9b6aed9ea61efe96e560386f2d0ea05d65f898f351c15451d449b1f17fca6679",
          "passage_sha256": "9b6aed9ea61efe96e560386f2d0ea05d65f898f351c15451d449b1f17fca6679",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-778412418cfa5e59.html#p-0-1794-9b6aed9ea61efe96"
        },
        {
          "passage_id": "law:pk-code-778412418cfa5e59:sha256:9c5a7f685190e27dc4dadb28d1e85c6ff0e76046cef599bac0ccb1bc661493f9:chars-1794-3511:8981ad8f777257bd07f0565ae83a04fc9fbb24dd220aadc9243d2c3572882d7f",
          "passage_sha256": "8981ad8f777257bd07f0565ae83a04fc9fbb24dd220aadc9243d2c3572882d7f",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/pk-code-778412418cfa5e59.html#p-1794-3511-8981ad8f777257bd"
        }
      ]
    },
    "order-recital": {
      "record_id": "punjab-code-4caa843ad99b6d9d",
      "text_version_id": "law:punjab-code-4caa843ad99b6d9d:sha256:4e4dcf430b69526d571c38c3a1be68db7742860de52f5c459490632daae4d633",
