      "source_url": "https://punjabcode.punjab.gov.pk/en/show_article/BzIFNws.ADY-",
      "character_start": 981,
      "character_end": 1476,
      "quote": "[10th August, 1973]\r\nNOTIFICATION\r\nNo. SO(ECB) - Ferti - 73(1)-- In exercise of the powers conferred by Section 3 of the  \r\nPunjab Essential Articles (Control) Ordinance, 1973 (Punjab Ordinance No. VII of 1973), The  \r\nGovernor of the Punjab is pleased to make the following Order:\r\n1. Short title and commencement:-  (1) This Order may be called the Punjab Fertilizers \r\n(Control) Order, 1973.\r\n(2) It extends to the whole of the Province of the Punjab.\r\n(3) It shall come into force at once.\r\n",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:punjab-code-4caa843ad99b6d9d:sha256:4e4dcf430b69526d571c38c3a1be68db7742860de52f5c459490632daae4d633:chars-0-1762:ae1974af034b4743eeddbdb13cd378e7296e0219a591f96cd95f93d1e1936e78",
          "passage_sha256": "ae1974af034b4743eeddbdb13cd378e7296e0219a591f96cd95f93d1e1936e78",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/punjab-code-4caa843ad99b6d9d.html#p-0-1762-ae1974af034b4743"
        }
      ]
    },
