    "newact-repeal": {
      "record_id": "punjab-code-8245b6faadb9789e",
      "text_version_id": "law:punjab-code-8245b6faadb9789e:sha256:fe9041b6bf524471e4b7b835f30fdb561c947ad44fc7ab239e3c97c22b6a7e00",
      "text_sha256": "fe9041b6bf524471e4b7b835f30fdb561c947ad44fc7ab239e3c97c22b6a7e00",
      "source_url": "https://punjabcode.punjab.gov.pk/en/show_article/BjZSZVRqVWYCYg--",
      "character_start": 43010,
      "character_end": 44070,
      "quote": "46. Repeal and savings.– (1) The Punjab Fertilizers (Control) Order, 1973 (VII of \r\n1973) is hereby repealed. \r\n (2) Clause (j) of sub -section (2) of section 3 and entry No. 40 of the Schedule \r\nto the Punjab Essential Articles (Control) Act, 1973 (XVII of 1973) are hereby repealed. \r\n (3) Notwithstanding the repeal of the Punjab Fertilizers (Control) Order, 1973 \r\n(VII of 1973), any act, proceeding, action or notification passed, taken or issued under \r\nthe repealed Order and Act shall, so far as it is not inconsis tent with the provisions of the \r\nAct, be deemed to have been pa ssed, taken or issued under the  Act and shall continue \r\nto have force unless it is superseded by an y act, proceeding, action or notification under \r\nthe Act.  \r\n (4) An offence committed in relation to a fertilizer under the Punjab Essential \r\nArticles (Control) Act, 1973 (XVII of 1973), if being investigated, prosecuted or tried, shall \r\ncontinue to be investigated prosecuted or tried as if the Punjab Essential Articles \r\n(Control) Act, 1973 has not been repealed.",
      "passages": [
        {
          "passage_id": "law:punjab-code-8245b6faadb9789e:sha256:fe9041b6bf524471e4b7b835f30fdb561c947ad44fc7ab239e3c97c22b6a7e00:chars-42403-44070:c44e18fb1f5039f06f85d97c86574166da4ce72588d71c10feb3ec02bf4991ab",
          "passage_sha256": "c44e18fb1f5039f06f85d97c86574166da4ce72588d71c10feb3ec02bf4991ab",
          "reader_url": "https://www.jusnrem.legal/laws/punjab-code-8245b6faadb9789e.html#p-42403-44070-c44e18fb1f5039f0"
        }
      ]
    }
